      'about.text': ' Khamlia Tour was born in a small village founded over half a century ago, whose population comes mostly from sub-Saharan Africa, descendants of slaves. After completing his training, a young man from the Oujeaa family returned to Khamlia to live there, and to share and showcase the place and country where he grew up, its culture and the warm hospitality of its people, with the aim of promoting a more sustainable and respectful tourism capable of building bonds between locals and visitors.',
